## SchedulesApi

### Create schedules
## Create schedules
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/schedules
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}


### Get Schedules
## Get Schedules
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/schedules?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}&order={{order}}&scheduleStatuses={{scheduleStatuses}}&scheduleType={{scheduleType}}&entityIds={{entityIds}}
Accept: application/json

### Update schedules
## Update schedules
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/schedules
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}

